sequenceDiagram
actor Agronomist as Agronomist
participant DiagnosisReviewPanel as Boundary: DiagnosisReviewPanel
participant DiagnosisReviewControl as Control: DiagnosisReviewControl
participant DiseaseDiagnosis as Entity: DiseaseDiagnosis
Agronomist->>DiagnosisReviewPanel: Open assigned diagnosis
DiagnosisReviewPanel->>DiagnosisReviewControl: Validate reviewer and decision
DiagnosisReviewControl->>DiseaseDiagnosis: Load original diagnosis evidence
DiseaseDiagnosis-->>DiagnosisReviewControl: Return immutable model evidence
DiagnosisReviewControl-->>DiagnosisReviewPanel: Persist review metadata and audit
DiagnosisReviewPanel-->>Agronomist: Display reviewed status
